          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A TRUE FATHERS DAY",
            "text": "<p>Golf is a sport of generations. Many of us owe our love for the game of golf to our dads - so we're going to honor them this season. For Father's Day we tip our cap to you, dads around the world, young and old, that are passing their love for the game down to the next generation.<br\/><br\/>We’re showing our appreciation for Dad with a <strong>buy one,<\/strong> <strong>get one 50% off anything site wide <\/strong>of equal or lesser value (excluding our recently released TOUR series footwear and Second Chance models) using code <strong>FATHERSDAY23. <\/strong>Get dad a pair of shoes, enjoy a polo for 50% off for yourself. Or lay on the gifts for the dad in your life with a rare TRUE discount.<\/p><p><br\/>But hurry, this offer is limited to the first 500 participants. Limited to one use per order.<\/p>",
